OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer accused of lying about
OL,4,Asearches linked to fatal crash denies
OL,5,Anot 'taking it seriously'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA police officer accused of lying about
OL,8,Fmissing person searches at the homes of
OL,9,Ftwo young women involved in a fatal
OL,10,Fcrash has denied not "taking it
OL,11,Fseriously" during a misconduct hearing.
OL,13,FPC Richard Hardwick is one of two
OL,14,Fofficers facing gross misconduct
OL,15,Fallegations over his actions before a
OL,16,Fcar carrying five people was found
OL,17,Fcrashed in St Mellons, Cardiff, on 6
OL,18,FMarch 2023.
OL,20,FEve Smith, Rafel Jeanne, and Darcy Ross
OL,21,Fall died in the crash, while Sophie
OL,22,FRusson and Shane Loughlin survived.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
