OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer accused of lying about
OL,4,Asearches linked to fatal crash denies
OL,5,Anot 'taking it seriously'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe three women were reported missing
OL,8,Fto Gwent Police on 4 March and Hardwick
OL,9,Fclaimed searches of the homes of Smith
OL,10,Fand Russon were carried out, but a
OL,11,Fhearing in Newport on Tuesday was told
OL,12,Fhe was lying.
